   "description": "GloParT-3 Wqq tagging SF for true W jets (FatJet_genMatch 1 or 2), cumulative: the SF of score > WP, score = (Xcs + Xqq/3) / (Xcs + Xqq/3 + QCD). Piecewise linear in WP between the measured points 0.78, 0.78; a WP outside [0.78, 0.78] is an error. pt clamped; above 800 GeV the last bin's nominal with 3x its up/down distances. eta is unused (inclusive in |eta| < 2.5). systematic: nom/up/down, absolute SF values. Source: Wqq_SF_correctionlib_etainclusive.json, era 2017",
